    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Ricky Vassan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102383563724433335834/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI0FgBE43mGakoxLHRtEs41Nm4x_EcpX2HfjqQucLIYBs0VZDk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Had a great experience at HGrégoire. Kristopher and Jordan helped me a lot and were very professional, friendly, and positive throughout the process. They took the time to answer all my questions and made everything smooth and stress-free. Really appreciate their support and would definitely recommend this place to others!",
        "time": 1767661532,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "andrei gheorghiu",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117357690655642394219/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIjBzaoO63Cgz9LVlCD2X2CLMTSmGwKXINjqsnrERj--34bFqU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Long story short- avoid them.partial information provided a sens of urgency created - lies and in the end we pay 100 cad for what? There is no mention on the bill why we pay it.. car was in st Eustache bu told us it cost us 100 to reserve - asking if is refundable - Alex the vendor said - we can arrange that later and once we been there fir the car presentation - see the pictures attached of what we found. Please avoid at all cost",
        "time": 1751325427,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Keith Chatman",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100691227805197470557/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVy1a6NnAP_fjH_TIWc2ab0V9n5F7Rv9eEEvNe6q1zMGmT5ZLrRUQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️\nBig thanks to Jordan Donato-Chretien for making my car-buying experience such a positive one. He was super respectful, patient, and really made me feel comfortable through the whole process. I appreciate his kindness and professionalism!!! I couldn’t have asked for better service! Thanks again Jordan..",
        "time": 1758645715,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ruby Vassan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107068451261791712002/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXHvWFY9dSavUMv_jPJN0-DmH8JfAGMOmSwh5GFE84JH65AjCQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Very good customer service. Kristopher and Jorden having very good knowledge and they both helped me in every way to find the vehicle I was looking for.\n\nThey deserve *****five stars.excellent service.",
        "time": 1767661561,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Scott Wilson",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110312607288066751842/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXMAfPO2Rkqb7mV9JAOYPZJX_yaqPHr_ctvBP80oVDMNmDtQfo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "2 weeks ago",
        "text": "Super friendly sales staff. Theo was awesome. After-sales was more difficult. Being hung up on by the after-sales director after a frustrating non-bilingual conversation about the unknown vehicle issues was not professional at all. Having the mechanic who did the inspection was even more unprofessional. They came off as very arrogant and thats’s where it all went south. They offered the minimal repairs (which I understand ; save your profit margin). However any reputable mechanic will always suggest to change additional parts you have to remove/disconnect while you're doing a repair as they’re typical wear & tear anyways, or at a minimum don't \"bandaid\" the problem. Change a CV axle instead of just a boot as an example. I would’ve been willing to pay the difference if it was offered. Then they expected me to drive back to their location over 177kms away from my home to do the work.   We ended up having to contact the general inquiry email account to get this resolved as the Aftersales Manager stopped replying. Ultimately the head office directed the Aftersale Manager to proceed with his original offer of reimbursement for the damaged parts (and it came accross very clearly it was Headoffice and not him that wanted to). There were additional mechanical issues that arose once the repairs began but I honestly didn't even want to deal with that Dept. anymore and just take the financial loss as a learning experience.       Great sales but hopefully you don't need to go back for anything, especially if these 2 employees are still employed at HGregoire.    I'm giving 2 stars because the Sales were great and the Headoffice followed thru with being reputable. -1 star for the Aftersales Manager. -1 star for the arrogant mechanic. -1 star for the entire experience.",
        "time": 1769950413,
        "translated": false
      }
